WEBVTT

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.320
Over this way! Hurry!

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.830
Wait!

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:26.760
Oh?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.830
I thought it was you, Coach.

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:34.470
H-Hi.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:38.440
You're alone?
You can't be.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.310
What's the matter?
You look really pale.

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:45.580
I-It's nothing.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:47.050
Want some?

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.680
You devil!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.560
Thanks for asking.
I'm fine now. See you.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:02.960
Wait a second!

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.360
Coach...

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.190
Are you...

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.720
Don't worry!  I've got him!

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:30.160
Thank you.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:36.690
Look how much
Soichiro's collected!

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.900
Rail pass holder?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.080
I wonder where he found this?

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:44.310
Let me see.

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.280
No coupons for beer?

00:03:48.380 --> 00:03:51.440
No. Just worthless stuff.

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.930
Hey! What're you
doing with that?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.150
I'm returning this
to its rightful owner.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.030
Well, that's fine.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.430
Hey everyone!

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:11.210
See ya!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:15.310
I wonder what Akemi's up to?

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:16.910
I dunno...

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.750
Next stop: Shibuya.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:33.250
Thanks for waiting!

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:34.320
Hi.

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:39.500
Hey! Are you really
going to help me?

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:40.830
You know...dogs.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.390
Of course!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.310
I'm putting you through training.

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.970
"T-Training"?

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:47.180
Yup.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:52.110
Fine.  I'll do anything.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.610
But...

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.510
Why don't we have lunch first?

00:04:57.660 --> 00:05:00.440
Sure. Let's go
somewhere I can drink.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:01.490
All right.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.880
Let's start here.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:07.020
Statue of Hachiko the dog?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.750
Pet him.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:10.630
Pet his head.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.870
B-But people are watching.

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.060
You said you'd do anything.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:15.930
But...

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.630
C'mon. Do it.

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:36.920
What the hell is he doing?

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.620
-What an idiot.
-Moron.

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.920
-Must have spring fever.
-You think?

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.970
I'm gonna need more help
to be able to help you.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.440
Please don't tell Ms. Otonashi.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.180
I know.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.490
Uh-huh. I knew it.

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:03.720
You knew it, Yotsuya?

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:08.510
I had a feeling, but you seem
to have known, Godai.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.580
Well, yeah.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.520
Coach Mitaka, huh?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:17.450
Can't we help him somehow?

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:21.390
With his fear of dogs, he says
he can't even get near Soichiro.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.370
Mitaka's desperate.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.500
All right.  I'll help.

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:30.000
I shall, as well.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.440
Really?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.440
Sure. Let's toast to that!
Cheers!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.310
Yotsuya!

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:19.060
My first experience?

00:07:20.390 --> 00:07:22.010
Yes, that's right.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.020
What made you
afraid of dogs?

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:27.870
Unless we determine
the root of your fear,

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.910
we won't come up with
the best course of action.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:36.550
I realize it'll be painful for you
to even recall the incident

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:39.410
but as long as you're in denial--

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:48.450
I understand.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:50.880
I'll tell you what happened.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.760
It was when I was still
in grade school.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.540
Oh, no. There goes another.

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.480
It's that dog again.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:15.120
What'll we do?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.620
What else? Go get it back.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:24.010
Hey! Poochie! Fetch!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:25.950
Over here!

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:29.870
Here I go!

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:34.020
Come here!

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.140
C'mon!

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.140
Hey! Get back!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:03.950
Until the dog's feeding time,
I was trapped in that dog house.

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:08.700
Yotsuya!

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:12.940
Mind if I take this back with me?

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.400
S-Sure.

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:16.110
Thanks.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:20.400
Y-Yotsuya!

00:09:20.650 --> 00:09:23.270
Don't you worry.
Leave everything to me.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.000
But...

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:28.850
Let's reenact that childhood
incident a week from today.

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:33.600
Hark, the barking dogs
The king's ears are
a donkey's bun

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:38.520
W-What was that?

00:09:39.340 --> 00:09:42.460
CLOCK HILL TENNIS CLUB

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:52.580
Mitaka!

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.750
So what's so important
that you wanted to talk about?

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.230
Thanks.

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.800
Let's see...This.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:22.580
Hold on.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:34.780
Take good care
of them, all right?

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:37.360
You gotta get used to them.

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:02.350
I can do this.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.290
Hey, Coach. Pay attention.

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.890
What's the matter
with Coach Mitaka?

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:25.160
He looks like he's lost weight.

00:11:40.890 --> 00:11:44.350
Question #4: What's more dangerous?
A barking dog with its head up high

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:48.280
or a growling dog
with its head down low?

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:51.600
They're both dangerous.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.210
Wrong answer.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:02.440
Next, a growling dog.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:13.050
I-I know!

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.380
Which one?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.350
The one that growls.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.090
Ding ding ding!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:21.790
Next, Question #5.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:22.970
Okay!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:29.890
65 points?

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.760
Not bad.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.470
He can more or less touch
stuffed dog dolls.

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:35.240
Really?

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.480
Maybe he's ready
for a real dog, then.

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.370
Perhaps.

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:21.120
N-No way.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.990
Hi. Going out?

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.490
Y-Yes, to the bookstore.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:48.700
It's quiet today.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:53.870
Akemi and everyone
went out today.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.280
Then that means--

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.180
What's going on?

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:03.610
I-It's nothing, really.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:04.490
Oh.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:11.440
Soichiro.

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.140
He's an obstacle
I must overcome.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.350
No matter what.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.380
This meat's kinda tough.

00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:31.760
That's right.
And then Ms. Otonashi will--

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.100
Hey, Coach.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.340
You haven't eaten anything.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.310
Would you like to do this
some other day?

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:41.680
No, I'm ready.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.210
I must do this.

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.220
Sure?

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.000
It's about time.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:47.680
All right, then.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:50.150
Okay...

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.150
Um...

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.280
What?

00:14:57.360 --> 00:14:58.990
It's time...isn't it?

00:14:59.440 --> 00:15:00.120
Yeah.

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:04.090
Three more beers!

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:07.360
Y-You're not coming with me?

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:10.740
No. You go it alone.

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:11.680
But--

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:15.200
I'll be waiting
right here for you.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.720
Don't cheat.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.640
Yeah. It's for
your own good, right?

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.770
That's right.
I can't rely on others.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.320
-That's right.
-Go get 'em.

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:47.640
Number 16 is a poodle
named Bokuchan.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.400
He's 14 months old.

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:52.240
Excuse me.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:53.340
Pardon me.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:01.450
I must say...

00:16:01.760 --> 00:16:03.960
that man sure is
giving it his all.

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:08.190
He's taking quite long,
though, don't you think?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.380
Oh yeah.
It's been an hour already.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.360
Maybe he took off.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.110
Oh, geez.

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.640
H-Hey!

00:16:21.610 --> 00:16:22.840
Ms. Otonashi.

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.430
How're you feeling?

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:44.470
I-I'm better now.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:47.900
I can look at dogs now.

00:16:48.240 --> 00:16:50.840
Maybe you should get more rest.

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:53.540
I'm so ashamed.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.440
Wanna put your head on my lap?

00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:57.900
N-No.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:17:00.330
C'mon. Don't be shy.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.070
N-Not here.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.960
Relax.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.280
Manager is a lucky woman.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.480
Thank you.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.780
I feel pretty good now.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.060
Let me see you home.

00:17:50.440 --> 00:17:55.460
I'm going to work. I'll be fired
if I skip out any more.

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:56.980
See ya!

00:17:58.950 --> 00:17:59.800
Take care.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:06.240
Mitaka!

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.240
What're you doing here?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.790
Manager and Godai
are on their way.

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:20.750
What's taking 'em so long?

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.490
I'll go get 'em.

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.430
Hey! Hey!

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.180
Manager!

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:40.550
Whatcha doin'? Hurry!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:42.740
Where's Soichiro?

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:45.270
Over there.
I left him with Mitaka.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.190
W-What?

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.120
H-Hold this, please.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.820
-What was that?
-Dunno.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.660
Shoo. Shoo.

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.210
Stay away!

00:19:02.740 --> 00:19:07.300
Calm down, Mitaka.
Remember your training.

00:19:08.190 --> 00:19:11.480
Question #7: In order to
escape from a dog, you must...

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:13.600
A) Run away as fast as possible.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:16.040
B) Hit the dog on the head with a stick.

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:18.580
C) Ignore the dog and walk away.

00:19:19.230 --> 00:19:20.450
Correct answer is C...

00:19:21.060 --> 00:19:22.320
Ignore the dog.

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.270
I-It's working!

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:02.730
No!

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.090
Mitaka, give me the leash!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:07.230
I'm sorry.

00:20:08.150 --> 00:20:09.330
It's okay.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:11.020
You all right?

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:12.490
A-Are they gone?

00:20:12.570 --> 00:20:13.370
Uh-huh.

00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:16.150
Mitaka?

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.070
Y-Yeah?

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:20.530
Manager's coming.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:22.650
All right. Thanks.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:28.070
Oh, no! Godai, you
take it from here.

00:20:28.520 --> 00:20:29.540
Oh, sure.

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.170
Where's Mitaka?

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:43.330
He said he has
an appointment or something.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.580
Oh.

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.530
I--

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:54.980
I just have this bad feeling.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:36.550
Deep within you is a scar from
a traumatic childhood experience.

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:42.760
By healing that scar, you will
surely get over your fear.

00:21:43.060 --> 00:21:46.510
To that end, you must relive
that very experience

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:49.700
and overcome it.
That's the only way.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:52.400
Let's begin!

00:21:54.240 --> 00:21:55.070
Here goes!

00:21:56.240 --> 00:21:57.030
Let's go.

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:00.990
-Run!
-Ms. Otonashi, here I go!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.770
Here's the ball.

00:22:10.290 --> 00:22:11.390
You okay?

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.730
I-I'm fine!

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:19.260
It's just a puppy.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.910
I can handle this.

00:22:30.150 --> 00:22:33.910
This is going to
boost his confidence.

00:22:40.700 --> 00:22:41.990
I did it! Look!

00:22:58.240 --> 00:23:01.680
How horrible. A car accident?

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:05.420
It was my fault for
not paying attention.

00:23:05.620 --> 00:23:08.510
You hadn't seemed
well lately, either.

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:11.340
See? You're sweating
a lot right now.

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:16.650
It's clean. Please use it.

00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:19.630
Thank you very much.

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:21.280
I appreciate it.

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:53.600
Yes. I do have vacancies...

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.770
But with such short notice--

00:23:55.900 --> 00:24:00.310
Next: "Kyoko Falls in Love at First Sight?!
A Stranger Moves into Maison Ikkoku"

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:04.280
Godai, this is no time
to be voicing the subtitle!
